                                                "sense_id": "72beeb8a-f813-36bd-9848-2edc8b90e539",
                                                "text": "But what do three testicles mean? A mystical trinity illuminating some absurd need to procreate? A symbol suggesting a metaphysic of pawnbroking? Likely as not, it is simply an animation of the familiar euphemism, \"the family jewels.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
